iphonebridge (0.9.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UI restyled after Messages, Phone and iOS Settings; read-state now
    syncs both ways; timestamps are stored in UTC (breaking); fixes for
    replies sorting to the top of a thread and for messages duplicated on
    every daemon restart. See CHANGELOG.md.

